cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tcepepy: Python client for the Open Data API of the Pernambuco Court of Accounts (TCE-PE)"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-07-14
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21366293
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/StrategicProjects/tcepepy"
url: "https://strategicprojects.github.io/tcepepy/"
abstract: >-
  Python client for the Open Data API of TCE-PE (Tribunal de Contas do Estado
  de Pernambuco). Wraps 71 API endpoints into functions that accept snake_case
  parameter names and return pandas DataFrames, with an offline catalog for
  endpoint discovery. Python port of the R package tceper.
keywords:
  - tce-pe
  - pernambuco
  - open-data
  - dados-abertos
  - government
  - brazil
  - python
